	(text "U20 unit 9 and the SoC decoupling. Left/bottom: juliancoy/zynqPCB power.sch (MIT, NOTICE), converted by\ntools/sheets/05_soc_power.py: only the decaps in the block copper, source refs and positions. Do not edit by\nhand. Changes: REUSE_LOG.md E5 (VCCPLL through FB501, FB1 = 0 ohm), E6 (C59/C122 on 1V8: MIO banks at 1.8 V).\nUG933 Tables 3-1/3-2 (CLG484, Z-7020) per merged rail; the C5xx rows add what the block lacks.\n0.47 uF within 12.7 mm of the BGA edge, 4.7 uF within 50 mm, bulk anywhere near (UG933 Ch. 3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "88b86472-d7ea-510f-8041-ca499c5b05a5")
	)
	(text "UG933 count, block + C5xx:\n1V0  (VCCINT+VCCBRAM+VCCPINT): 330u 1, 100u 2, 4u7 4, 470n 8\n     block C28 100u, C9 C24 4u7, C8 C23 C29 C30 C31 470n (+ C11 10u)\n1V8  (VCCAUX+VCCPAUX+MIO0+MIO1+VCCO_0): 100u 3, 47u 2, 4u7 4, 470n 5\n     block C5 C19 C20 C59 C122 4u7, C4 C14 C15 C17 C18 C34 470n (+ C26 C33 10u)\nVCCPLL: 120R bead + 10u 0603 + 0.47-4.7u 0402 within 5.1 mm of the H10/GND vias\n1V35 (VCCO_DDR): 100u 1, 4u7 1, 470n 4; sheet 1 has C99 100u, C100 4u7, C101 470n\n3V3  (VCCO_13/33/34/35): 47u 1 (one per four HR banks), 4u7 8, 470n 16\n     block C61 47u, C67 100u, C57 C114 4u7, ten 470n (banks 13/33; banks 34/35 had VCCO on GND)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 294.64 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8c501efa-4b8f-5ac2-9366-083662ff7c97")
	)
